	"_comment": "Traits v3 (docs/gdd/03-colony/traits-v3/). NOT loaded by Defs unless balance.traits_v3_enabled is true. Effects are additive stats read via TraitSystemV3.mod(); every stat key must exist in `stats` (consumer registry). thought_<id>: -1.0 = ignore that thought, +1.0 = double. Rarity draw in file order, fixed rng draw count (see roll_birth).",
